''Stationeers'' is currently not available to the public. The latest beta build available at Rezzed 2017 had the following systems implemented:

* Atmospherics
* Gravity
* Hydroponics
* Basic [[survival]]
* AI entities
* Basic [[building|construction]]
* Dedicated servers
* Physics
* Pipes and cables
* Medical
* [[Mining]]

The following systems are planned for the coming months:

* Electricity
* Surgery
* [[Shuttle]]s
* Computers
* [[Planets]]
* Radiation
* Customizable characters of both sexes
* Cloning
* New machines
